{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "山", "id": "山"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "母", "id": "母"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "登", "id": "登"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.7683391950199565, "source": "子", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 2.0560212674717375, "source": "子", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.0560212674717375, "source": "子", "target": "弟"}, {"weight": 1.9914827463341662, "source": "子", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.0560212674717375, "source": "子", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 0.5155762265245886, "source": "子", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.0560212674717375, "source": "子", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 1.4806571225681755, "source": "見", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.3265064427409172, "source": "臣", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.0196536233008624, "source": "臣", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.508827999534872, "source": "人", "target": "恥"}, {"weight": 1.4600378353654397, "source": "人", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.6333592621809719, "source": "人", "target": "山"}, {"weight": 1.1033628914267075, "source": "人", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.9210413346327528, "source": "人", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 3.5600986642480112, "source": "山", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 3.5600986642480112, "source": "山", "target": "登"}, {"weight": 1.4806571225681755, "source": "王", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 1.7965100719866527, "source": "事"